cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "ChiReSSD"
abstract: >-
  Speaker-preserving reconstruction of pediatric disordered speech. Given a
  target transcript and a short reference recording from a child with a speech
  sound disorder, ChiReSSD synthesizes the target utterance with canonical
  pronunciation while preserving the child's speaker identity and prosody.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lab-MSP/ChiReSSD"
url: "https://lab-msp.github.io/ChiReSSD/"
keywords:
  - speech disorders
  - speech reconstruction
  - speech-language pathology
  - text-to-speech
  - child speech

